You bind light in a glyph on the floor. All enemies walking over the glyph will be slowed by [18%, 23%, 26%, 29%, 31% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.

The glyph is a hidden trap ([33, 47, 58, 67, 75 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] detection and [33, 47, 58, 67, 75 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] disarm power based on your Magic) and lasts for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.
